    "将终止当前列表中所有会话的运行命令与常驻守护进程，未保存的运行状态可能会中断。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This will terminate running commands and standing daemons across all sessions in the list. Unsaved progress may be lost."
          }
